{"type":"message","id":"41c9996a","parentId":"f1fcb92b","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:16:35.218Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_pGqwFuQ0g3HcnOnHCz49H66j|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018252ad948191967b58a3e50a768e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Albert · Dashboard MVP</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --border: #30363d;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n    main {\n      width: min(960px, 100%);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 6vw, 2.4rem);\n    }\n    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n    section {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 16px;\n      min-height: 170px;\n    }\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }\n    li { margin: 6px 0; }\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 4px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .85rem;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .safe { color: var(--ok); }\n    .warn { color: var(--warn); }\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 7px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n    .bar {\n      height: 9px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      margin: 5px 0 10px;\n    }\n    .bar > span {\n      display: block;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: inherit;\n      background: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .bar .ok { background: var(--ok); }\n    .bar .warn-bg { background: var(--warn); }\n    .small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 18px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <header>\n      <h1>Dashboard MVP</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Albert + neodaemon · local, privado, mínimo viable</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <section>\n        <h2>Hoy</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Prioridad del día: pendiente de definir.</li>\n          <li>Top 3 tareas: usar el log diario.</li>\n          <li>Resumen diario: programado a las 09:00.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Fuente futura: /daily/YYYY/MM/DD.md</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Salud / movilidad</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Dolor 0-10: —</li>\n          <li>Rigidez matutina: —</li>\n          <li>Estiramientos: —</li>\n          <li>Notas: seguimiento prudente, no médico.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">MVP salud</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Hábitos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Sueño: —</li>\n          <li>Alimentación: —</li>\n          <li>Deporte: —</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Pilares diarios</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Pendientes / caos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Capturar cosas sueltas aquí.</li>\n          <li>Ordenar por prioridad.</li>\n          <li>Convertir caos en próximos pasos.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">Anticaos</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Uso LLM / tokens</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens entrada</span><strong>21k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens salida</span><strong>1.8k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Contexto</span><strong>31k / 272k · 11%</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Cache</span><strong>53% hit · 24k cached</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Límite diario</span><strong>93% libre · ~2h 30m</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Snapshot manual · 2026-05-10 10:28 CEST</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Eficiencia · tokens por tarea útil</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tareas útiles hoy</span><strong>1</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens / tarea útil</span><strong>~16.5k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Picos anómalos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Bajo valor / repetitivas</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <p class=\"small\">Canales hoy</p>\n        <div class=\"small\">Telegram · ~16.5k</div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span class=\"warn-bg\" style=\"width: 72%\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"small\">TUI · 0</div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width: 0%\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"small\">Automatizaciones · 0</div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width: 0%\"></span></div>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">MVP local · estimado desde snapshots</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Salud del sistema</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Estabilidad</span><strong class=\"safe\">100/100</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Gateway uptime</span><strong>13h 40m</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>RAM</span><strong>14% · 1689/11800 MB</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>CPU load</span><strong>0.07 · 0.04 · 0.00</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens/hora</span><strong>~607</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Loops detectados</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Consumo anómalo</span><strong>no</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Observación MVP · sin reinicio automático</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Tools / plugins</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins descubiertos</span><strong>92</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins activos</span><strong>67</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins deshabilitados</span><strong>25</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugin doctor</span><strong class=\"safe\">limpio</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Skills elegibles</span><strong>7</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Automatizaciones</span><strong>3 activas</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Advertencias</span><strong class=\"warn\">3 prudentes</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">Auditoría solo lectura · sin cambios</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section>\n        <h2>Seguridad</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><span class=\"safe\">Privado por defecto.</span></li>\n          <li>No expuesto a internet.</li>\n          <li>Sin credenciales en el proyecto.</li>\n          <li>Core intocable para neodaemon.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Solo Albert + neodaemon</span>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n      MVP estático. Siguiente iteración: leer datos reales del log diario, sin abrir acceso externo todavía.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778483795218}}
{"type":"message","id":"5c07be8e","parentId":"41c9996a","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:16:44.182Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering static implementation**\n\nI’m thinking about implementing a static option without backend involvement. First, I need to determine if that’s doable and create a dashboard to visualize data. I could use JS's localStorage to save values because persistent storage is tricky in static files. I’ll implement a form in HTML and maybe include a blood pressure graph with localStorage, which is browser-specific. I might even create a JSON file for metrics to support local interactions. Let's patch this together!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018254a0fc8191b30ee7f674ca0d18\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAYJb_Krs7R4ybezw2D3YYXUPdiJt0TrJAOaxdBxKXgWVcZB0CLzaSdMP2SYsZeXKe_JH1dw6XpO9klGjEIkNzel24oIridRYL_0dZsun3ZwNiOW2D4rrRlth9WnGRGSWFGbW-7awsxnQ8BSGB_MbSRn2ic-D6liqELARF5NOllsa5AGRJYxPNbGH5nKs5wnGwdp1r_tk2H1VJXZEl0SpDG2Y3qOgRVWLnMeD088W8ROhbTH1MbQZkmXauDA096CjcnTxuQ9S7slll8EXq2yOjsvmxKd4o3lhiHk9zCP0aW4jsWuMl7r_niKcaS4E2qJQeYAc04u6cJsoRkyYNPzlKat04meeNeeemWVDjotri-XiOAWfAclFBRWnpGjuKCAKNAwselIUnHMLx6FZPVZOl75laPInBc6ek9jagw6pNsYWArK3q1H_6ZmdArJDaUmKwnWdgpEP00pi4Wc3g1xnG-2DJQ0tQsjXu0pFj2cAcYp16y1T87MhdMkQYfJA00YWbtVlh5SWoEp8pFgJMo33LuvYY1iP35XzhACvChUwomWPQdRj-FMILyVzQIH7bo-YLDzYSo8vpLo8e_wJoPLRZaQGxACOaX4bGRoqleHCgEcvUr2tssEP8JANtcvqx4PeVGxCt02C4jTKZOx5ZdVO8gtFA2Gq4X8HCKDrLyxwpkVZONHi3EB0I_yrJWidKaydEK1WgGU9C8V0Glir0r_NYZoQ-AdckIVLYun3hQamDXpjWOLBJZqEJOhTC3V5TkpzwzzzQWQ_kZNWK5dr9Y9a3TGI9RBxdcP98TNiWCNVfRprgGdTXGZeOuyE4etozApKv4XTHCy3C3qTAy-sJTg-s5HY1Oxmhc9jXEm4Yz2AmTxNo6nr4EMIG2iRUDgbeyptMYKA95KWkdkUKhHkkwWnnE_GpDWTo0H39opltxpEgSnve7IXqadaV4VvC6t0y1ada4KMNi04C6GXtGHTBrWZ3UawcfPZ0lLY3NhuFIZ6n5jFKqRYMvA-ys8xlcrpZksXlP4MzydeUhevs1BA1xY4V0GVdPOV_vuluOWsGmnEiODmVR_vhfwAWN6CJiketkgmgtqSoUy9HIksrtGjzawgUhreu3q6q-4dXLOPV3TnM_xgG6QgwqoHTA0IVpk-_oa_Lh53d6uXy5DBaaOh