ow what changes are necessary. Let's see if I can figure it out by examining the existing code!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Tienes razón, Albert. Para una pantalla apaisada ese ancho fijo de 960px está desaprovechando mucho espacio. Lo ajusto para que sea más tipo panel ancho, manteniendo márgenes cómodos.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01830445ec8191a14b6728f66b41b6\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_iAhpqzdFRarn6t9y1jTrZzUX|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018304afc48191b00bef61e6e69c63","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html')\ns=p.read_text()\ns=s.replace('''    main {\n      width: min(960px, 100%);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }''','''    main {\n      width: min(1800px, 100%);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: clamp(14px, 2vw, 28px);\n    }''')\ns=s.replace('''    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n    }''','''    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n      gap: 16px;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n    @media (min-width: 1200px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n    }\n    @media (min-width: 1600px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n    }''')\ns=s.replace('''    canvas {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 220px;''','''    canvas {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: clamp(240px, 26vh, 360px);''')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\nfrom pathlib import Path\nHTMLParser().feed(Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text())\nprint('html parse ok')\nPY\ngrep -n \"width: min\\|grid-template-columns\\|height: clamp\" dashboard/index.html","workdir":"/openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","pro