{"type":"custom_message","customType":"openclaw.runtime-context","content":"[media attached: /home/openclaw/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_2---906a8988-bfd2-4833-adfb-116f4df01e17.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/openclaw/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_2---906a8988-bfd2-4833-adfb-116f4df01e17.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Absolute and ~ paths only work when they stay inside your allowed file-read boundary; host file:// URLs are blocked. Keep caption in the text body.\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:8785888003\",\n  \"message_id\": \"486\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"8785888003\",\n  \"sender\": \"OpenClaw Bunker\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-11 09:26 GMT+2\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"OpenClaw Bunker (8785888003)\",\n  \"id\": \"8785888003\",\n  \"name\": \"OpenClaw Bunker\"\n}\n```\n\n<media:image>","display":false,"details":{"source":"openclaw-runtime-context"},"id":"b04d1a59","parentId":"6885bd33","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:26:30.464Z"}
{"type":"message","id":"d1f1dc00","parentId":"b04d1a59","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:27:24.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Designing a dashboard layout**\n\nI’m planning a dashboard with a height of 1080, structured into 6 columns. For the first row, I’m considering having BP span 4 columns, possibly extending to 2 rows, alongside a system that spans 2. The top cards might create unwanted space before the graph, which could be below the fold. I want to prioritize placing the blood pressure card at the top-left since it’s essential. Also, I'll make sure to arrange the compact side cards in a neat way!\n\n**Addressing a bug issue**\n\nI need to fix a bug involving the BP_STORAGE_KEY, where it looks like it's truncated to 'neodae…e.v1'. I’m wondering if the actual file is showing an ellipsis because of this truncation. Earlier, I saw grep output that had ellipsis too, so I think I need to run the grep command again to get to the bottom of this. I want to ensure I have the full, accurate information before proceeding!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0184a882d88191b488e9070e30fe19\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAYS5sa2DxdHDVwy0fRLkxaSGXWPvY_X0wxSbQ_UrnpAFS04ATideGMmFK6PspIqgo6E8a-pFj7uePLzXLm-ajygQqV91LvQuLBQL4B31bUp0CQthCfWyFopCBjtSgdFPQL-WoJhXIA2fom4dTd0XFbmCgJ3O4GMkVOFZvT0AIgKmwAhpTxpUIEWHReh3MHB9R7tn_nV3I1Z7nFKO54s_91Qt8KrRjZFaQ9VN2TfnFENUHwEJhT7y9m5Kvgs1bYxSjOWUprSzi003VSo1sfyS0s961Vq2z-5N9w8XMlbJ-mTK1Pi_0JI_xa4YxZFU1C5FSsuJdISrK7_qmuaSrWH8Qc7DgunnWq9TtJiLH1ShN6NVB7hVHsfIpNJ5LnHf2uqCxh2wuyl-lWSzlSeMFKfhSnmp6ybtzbRLW1-8tq6WYkQF9Gqeyszyh6qlt19Xu07HfmfUb4ctXDUTwkkQ_l0WyPWO8bggApInas8AnpGxEyiF_b7R1QybxCK7vloGwTRkygPTgSLIM1OpHhc8iD-4Cil9lzIFIIXBQUrCUMjNsRm1jIYWTSkg4H1SmK0mU0hL_9ogxXQbS75vD1ZTQ8qRByR1RHue2COlaESdfBxFfLuO-7q8xr0pAEYZYCP-zNuM2xd8t8dUGCREt7c81PqCPJ-2Nw4u4H1ws6Ex29UPZquWiLd-wdeggyGKdk8SYG3rDvCygEHx6ZvBVmSZ9yKHhG5NupLhz76uWee2aQORIzSI5k1vlw4j5fIxeC44V3I9Ie9AMndGcaA55