Gxq77j1gb4VD5Jz-pP2aGTLWRjIYcvk5cELw7d4MMyIXr4IoHTBNA01xyok7V_mQrvs3B97Gc1eIBQEw7xmac1QaJAL4OM7IVgAmPAaZNaiNP9ZzahPwPOnumB7k9hM_ft6g7ONEqCCqhth2H798FpyG7mWCoBs9B3VWBJ09oqxlo3mWkVFERtOosBjYKVNRMiCFZIqrGyC1-2Lr-eyukZf7ijhbh59LQc5fAtZrP6R5kbFEul3AsoHaqBIpKzOXyf7n5EHQDqHuawCSyLWE2IYapk8QpaBILOZxKLV3npjG496RBwxoT_y8vScRmo_oMZ8gujeXYR4Ptq_Vh5v7nAIcYz0-VPRWT0J6c1g_RV6VKl5gbVqrNuThLn-1uSi8I19U-s_r3JWSzVeO_lYW7-0BJ4OkPulXqjA3YtscYBoEX-z7SjNpkDIBbHxH9PGeM-QFy3NszfKwXlHty2fo8Xvs3OOk7bAotQbgt_aSrcghkUTExSQR4myIVUqYQ-iR2XDuFdBnR_qHANpBY_qIOk5qInfyebm33e2LHwoHuIKJWbx8uGdLAXZ6IgLPYB9bb-Y5JG8NnzF1OsfQ5zY16de-AubkfN3BiGWh23DHDQm6-bSq_Z8myatiuAj1xIqjhuVN-PoTttzczCidm3bpIxUP3U5fCntNOOFbiddzxj2UwOVpnPZtHprg1WE3A==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Designing a dashboard layout**\\n\\nI’m planning a dashboard with a height of 1080, structured into 6 columns. For the first row, I’m considering having BP span 4 columns, possibly extending to 2 rows, alongside a system that spans 2. The top cards might create unwanted space before the graph, which could be below the fold. I want to prioritize placing the blood pressure card at the top-left since it’s essential. Also, I'll make sure to arrange the compact side cards in a neat way!\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Addressing a bug issue**\\n\\nI need to fix a bug involving the BP_STORAGE_KEY, where it looks like it's truncated to 'neodae…e.v1'. I’m wondering if the actual file is showing an ellipsis because of this truncation. Earlier, I saw grep output that had ellipsis too, so I think I need to run the grep command again to get to the bottom of this. I want to ensure I have the full, accurate information before proceeding!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Ahora lo veo claro: seguimos poniendo demasiadas tarjetas “resumen” antes de lo importante. Voy a cambiar el orden visual: **tensión arterial arriba a la izquierda como bloque principal**, salud del sistema arriba a la derecha, y debajo las tarjetas pequeñas. Eso aprovechará mucho mejor el primer pantallazo.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0184b9814481919c9ab1ad4403891d\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_LEdursyvc6ZKkhBf9gtFyObn|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0184b9c0808191b6e9813b90f151b8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html')\ns=p.read_text()\n# Add compact helper if not present\nif '.compact {' not in s:\n    s=s.replace('''    .technical { opacity: .92; }''','''    .technical { opacity: .92; }\n    .compact { min-height: 104px; }\n    .compact ul { font-size: .94rem; }\n    .compact .pill { font-size: .8rem; }''')\n# Make chart a little taller but stable for first viewport\ns=s.replace('''      height: clamp(260px, 32vh, 390px);''','''      height: clamp(300px, 36vh, 420px);''')\nstart=s.index('    <div class=\"grid\">')\nend=s.index('    <footer>', start)\nnew_grid='''    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <section class=\"span-4 priority-card\" id=\"blood-pressure-section\">\n        <h2>Tensión arterial</h2>\n        <p class=\"small\">Registro privado en este navegador. Guarda sistólica, diastólica, pulso y la fecha/hora de introducción.</p>\n        <form id=\"bp-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <label>Sistólica\n              <input id=\"bp-sys\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"60\" max=\"260\" placeholder=\"120\" required />\n            </label>\n            <label>Diastólica\n              <input id=\"bp-dia\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"40\" max=\"160\" placeholder=\"80\" required />\n            </label>\n            <label>Pulso opcional\n              <input id=\"bp-pulse\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"30\" max=\"220\" placeholder=\"70\" />\n            </label>\n            <label>Fecha y hora\n              <input id=\"bp-datetime\" type=\"datetime-local\" required />\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <button type=\"submit\">Añadir lectura</button>\n            <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"bp-export\" type=\"button\">Exportar JSON</button>\n            <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"bp-clear\" type=\"button\">Borrar registros</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n        <canvas id=\"bp-chart\" width=\"900\" height=\"260\" aria-label=\"Gráfica de tensión arterial\" role=\"img\"></canvas>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n          <table>\n            <thead>\n              <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sistólica</th><th>Diastólica</th><th>Pulso</th></tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody id=\"bp-table-body\">\n              <tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"small\">Todavía no hay lecturas.</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"pill\">MVP local · datos en localStorage</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"span-2 technical priority-card\">\n        <h2>Salud del sistema</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Estabilidad</span><strong class=\"safe\">100/100</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Gateway uptime</span><strong>13h 40m</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>RAM</span><strong>14% · 1689/11800 MB</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>CPU load</span><strong>0.07 · 0.04 · 0.00</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens/hora</span><strong>~607</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Loops detectados</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Consumo anómalo</span><strong>no</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Observación MVP · sin reinicio automático</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"compact priority-card\">\n        <h2>Hoy</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Prioridad: pendiente.</li>\n          <li>Top 3: log diario.</li>\n          <li>Resumen: 09:00.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">/daily/YYYY/MM/DD.md</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"compact\">\n        <h2>Salud / movilidad</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Dolor 0-10: —</li>\n          <li>Rigidez: —</li>\n          <li>Estiramientos: —</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">MVP salud</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"compact\">\n        <h2>Hábitos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Sueño: —</li>\n          <li>Alimentación: —</li>\n          <li>Deporte: —</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Pilares diarios</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"compact\">\n        <h2>Pendientes / caos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Capturar.</li>\n          <li>Priorizar.</li>\n          <li>Convertir en pasos.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">Anticaos</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"compact\">\n        <h2>Seguridad</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><span class=\"safe\">Privado.</span></li>\n          <li>No expuesto a internet.</li>\n          <li>Sin credenciales.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Solo Albert + neodaemon</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"compact technical\">\n        <h2>Uso LLM / tokens</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Entrada</span><strong>21k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Salida</span><strong>1.8k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Contexto</span><strong>11%</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Snapshot manual</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"section-kicker\">Observabilidad técnica</div>\n\n      <section class=\"span-2 technical\">\n        <h2>Eficiencia · tokens por tarea útil</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tareas útiles hoy</span><strong>1</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens / tarea útil</span><strong>~16.5k</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Picos anómalos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Bajo valor / repetitivas</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n        <p class=\"small\">Canales hoy</p>\n        <div class=\"small\">Telegram · ~16.5k</div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span class=\"warn-bg\" style=\"width: 72%\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"small\">TUI · 0</div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width: 0%\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"small\">Automatizaciones · 0</div>\n        <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width: 0%\"></span></div>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">MVP local · estimado desde snapshots</span>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"span-2 technical\">\n        <h2>Tools / plugins</h2>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins descubiertos</span><strong>92</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins activos</span><strong>67</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins deshabilitados</span><strong>25</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugin doctor</span><strong class=\"safe\">limpio</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Skills elegibles</span><strong>7</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Automatizaciones</span><strong>3 activas</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\"><span>Advertencias</span><strong class=\"warn\">3 prudentes</strong></div>\n        <span class=\"pill warn\">Auditoría solo lectura · sin cambios</span>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n'''\ns=s[:start]+new_grid+s[end:]\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\nfrom pathlib import Path\nHTMLParser().feed(Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text())\nprint('html parse ok')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY' >/tmp/dashboard-bp.js\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\ns=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text()\nprint(re.findall(r'<script>(.*?)</script>', s, re.S)[0])\nPY\nnode --check /tmp/dashboard-bp.js\ngrep -n \"compact\\|blood-pressure-section\\|height: clamp\" dashboard/index.html | head -20","workdir":"/openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":3040,"output":2841,"cacheRead":36352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42233,"cost":{"input":0.015200000000000002,"output":0.08523,"cacheRead":0.018175999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.118606}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778484390464,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0184a710688191824aacab100a2fa2"}}
