{"type":"message","id":"00e749f6","parentId":"1a97e356","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:32:16.986Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Figuring out JSONL and dashboard updates**\n\nI need to write a JSONL file and possibly update the dashboard to fetch new data. The request, \"Tensión arterial ahora...\" suggests they want us to log the information. Since there's no direct local storage in the browser, I'll create a canonical file that the dashboard can use. I should inspect the current script to check the corrupted key issue. We attempted a fix, but it still isn’t working. I’ll proceed to edit carefully and read the relevant script.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0185fca3ec8191addb2b2f0981c774\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAYYA6pYVDGuW8EMXudHV_1wDJupeGY4ASigZCKSQ8MBuO_5nLa2pjBLZdqb9AxUUNKdYupJxvw6owSiXlRa4TGlWRW9ddwZ42I-mY-1ESQd3xZ-qyTzfnd_Mcqiw5NPo_weDSXs_dMgQj2w0dTBvLecXZC-j4cbd3sBBC5jiyKaUfFCQpdCp53R05TUGtuo8Tob-o4K7d7vodvTeuG6JeHDGwYfBjOD6SdN97hkRj_0cUE4dBptFoJhMh7G_H3oWLNKkdIeel4zRNQDciUVZYPSp53OaPONuDubbUN9bLc-D6Ut6v6QNSFSzJUd5xBQmm0h-fC29SiZIynQF3NFGvVwQnpXL2e5DUBiQTfnbIUwjjA7U8EkXa7mf57XR70OG422CZia-V4g4_ZRVs_u10OV1bFDQ-ZpqZXiXJInus2CTRnWtRsMeOLKQSJgb2S9SLceW74j0ics4q1LiUZsTNQV4Mh25ofENfs-5c_T1-M943CPDCbHapUCu73INJay7z38xiOjrcyEfxsQF7Da2DfydGaAEldpdvx0yiEN7aG2xXUBaEa_MPgCJtswMFrKu5mC2JNCjuE_4Ki7t7gSgQEt2N8JgD-MInDZ3xOyJOmXqZV6DXo8ki95IeOl0ledakmJTTj_SK-VCvBveSjndX-6tRUTerruvsGmQLdFfx1sZdU5djthoo2UPkt89G7DD4UFGkZFyoYIfy0Fvam9mmNWgNwEUaL7ENEp45nLpd0j09rcUS_LWf1hHwVSYPLjsQ6BrBr19I2LZpmefUUw_9P8baMFYvevmtxEfPMin4TP5q3wwLVxVtB2TB9xETn4C990JWfdPq7D9myNBo2v0QkZQv9fXKd2og3bNK47T6xH7z9Xybw1iPbTsX59NTh0qLIpMrunsky9MfHEPeujwhZeh55NJgX5YOYw-lc2T1UW5WEmnoK-F8awUMn251z8teJMyLFwyrapEWfsprI2X0epjIMfQJZfAqfV3d7XRBGNDhDlfEhYg-ZRzc-6p1p__kxPfSjPngE4uTWBQLBWDVW4IxUy2XHR8PsJoizzsAtVPE5oCJSdy3hMrciU4TcDhkJd8Qye_j6NxYmPjPgNFXnak8SbBqFpv8TkL4fRYatE3OeLnnmfSlEf0VjQHKdStcZVj0C10MkMXEcBSV0rXFFQ8eYxZwBwYYMa91YT6dzfm2_H2qZGEwltQPjddNSsIdJ0KMei4zUHb154AEkMuMLUWwT1SfyY1LLPcOW3O69Q2BA3wjaAbDUFy4trcqYjuv49kq9urTlFlV4C4lbTSagLZ-gECPqOlN7uTsdqd4yD1Kue5SfHUf4LZX0kX_oBXoHAjnGGJCguHXJ9jfkAv-0upC7KExsZ_nNROYdl56fhjHQnRUt0xeLMkXy0RHSI6BURvvvl1yZoi9fuFw3SOqDNSH0BZdKAo2-QVwA8nO9fAefnPFfHOmB2mXYY98_JuC2wvs93Zt3VEHaObva9NEyuctghQ5w29pLJKxVbWFpM4LCM=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Figuring out JSONL and dashboard updates**\\n\\nI need to write a JSONL file and possibly update the dashboard to fetch new data. The request, \\\"Tensión arterial ahora...\\\" suggests they want us to log the information. Since there's no direct local storage in the browser, I'll create a canonical file that the dashboard can use. I should inspect the current script to check the corrupted key issue. We attempted a fix, but it still isn’t working. I’ll proceed to edit carefully and read the relevant script.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bK0uXp1zrHUcjtmEW4T4FqZP|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01860098f8819194f2b4fb2c3c600c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html","offset":360,"limit":220}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":654,"output":121,"cacheRead":46592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47367,"cost":{"input":0.0032700000000000003,"output":0.00363,"cacheRead":0.023295999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030195999999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778484730592,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0185fab7288191bed45e601281df60"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c67f433b","parentId":"00e749f6","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:32:16.991Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bK0uXp1zrHUcjtmEW4T4FqZP|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01860098f8819194f2b4fb2c3c600c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const BP_STORAGE_KEY = 'neodae…e.v1';\n    const DASHBOARD_LAYOUT_KEY = 'neodae…t.v1';\n\n    function localDatetimeValue(date = new Date()) {\n      const offsetMs = date.getTimezoneOffset() * 60000;\n      return new Date(date.getTime() - offsetMs).toISOString().slice(0, 16);\n    }\n\n    function loadBpReadings() {\n      try {\n        return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(BP_STORAGE_KEY) || '[]')\n          .filter(r => Number.isFinite(r.systolic) && Number.isFinite(r.diastolic) && r.recordedAt)\n          .sort((a, b) => new Date(a.recordedAt) - new Date(b.recordedAt));\n      } catch {\n        return [];\n      }\n    }\n\n    function saveBpReadings(readings) {\n      localStorage.setItem(BP_STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(readings));\n    }\n\n    function formatDate(value) {\n      return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-ES', {\n        dateStyle: 'short',\n        timeStyle: 'short'\n      }).format(new Date(value));\n    }\n\n    function drawBpChart(readings) {\n      const canvas = document.getElementById('bp-chart');\n      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n      const w = canvas.width;\n      const h = canvas.height;\n      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#0b1017';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n      const pad = { left: 48, right: 18, top: 20, bottom: 34 };\n      const minY = 40;\n      const maxY = 200;\n      const xFor = i => readings.length === 1\n        ? (pad.left + (w - pad.left - pad.right) / 2)\n        : pad.left + i * ((w - pad.left - pad.right) / (readings.length - 1));\n      const yFor = value => pad.top + (maxY - value) * ((h - pad.top - pad.bottom) / (maxY - minY));\n\n      ctx.strokeStyle = '#30363d';\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#8b949e';\n      ctx.font = '13px system-ui, sans-serif';\n      [60, 80, 120, 140, 180].forEach(v => {\n        const y = yFor(v);\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.moveTo(pad.left, y);\n        ctx.lineTo(w - pad.right, y);\n        ctx.stroke();\n        ctx.fillText(String(v), 8, y + 4);\n      });\n\n      if (!readings.length) {\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#8b949e';\n        ctx.fillText('Añade tu primera lectura para ver la gráfica.', pad.left, h / 2);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      function plot(key, color, label) {\n        ctx.strokeStyle = color;\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        readings.forEach((r, i) => {\n          const x = xFor(i);\n          const y = yFor(r[key]);\n          if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y); else ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n        });\n        ctx.stroke();\n        readings.forEach((r, i) => {\n          ctx.fillStyle = color;\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          ctx.arc(xFor(i), yFor(r[key]), 4, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n          ctx.fill();\n        });\n        ctx.fillStyle = color;\n        ctx.fillText(label, w - pad.right - 120, key === 'systolic' ? 22 : 42);\n      }\n\n      plot('systolic', '#ff7b72', 'Sistólica');\n      plot('diastolic', '#58a6ff', 'Diastólica');\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#8b949e';\n      readings.forEach((r, i) => {\n        if (i % Math.ceil(readings.length / 5) === 0 || i === readings.length - 1) {\n          ctx.fillText(formatDate(r.recordedAt).replace(', ', '\\n'), Math.max(48, xFor(i) - 28), h - 10);\n        }\n      });\n    }\n\n    function renderBp() {\n      const readings = loadBpReadings();\n      const body = document.getElementById('bp-table-body');\n      if (!readings.length) {\n        body.innerHTML = '<tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"small\">Todavía no hay lecturas.</td></tr>';\n      } else {\n        body.innerHTML = readings.slice().reverse().map(r => `\n          <tr>\n            <td>${formatDate(r.recordedAt)}</td>\n            <td>${r.systolic}</td>\n            <td>${r.diastolic}</td>\n            <td>${r.pulse || '—'}</td>\n          </tr>\n        `).join('');\n      }\n      drawBpChart(readings);\n    }\n\n\n    function initDraggableCards() {\n      const grid = document.querySelector('.grid');\n      const cards = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card[data-card]'));\n      const resetButton = document.getElementById('reset-layout');\n      let dragged = null;\n\n      function saveLayout() {\n        const order = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card[data-card]')).map(card => card.dataset.card);\n        localStorage.setItem(DASHBOARD_LAYOUT_KEY, JSON.stringify(order));\n      }\n\n      function applySavedLayout() {\n        let order = [];\n        try { order = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(DASHBOARD_LAYOUT_KEY) || '[]'); } catch { order = []; }\n        if (!order.length) return;\n        const cardsById = new Map(Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card[data-card]')).map(card => [card.dataset.card, card]));\n        const firstTechnicalKicker = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.section-kicker')).find(k => k.textContent.includes('Observabilidad'));\n        order.forEach(id => {\n          const card = cardsById.get(id);\n          if (card) grid.insertBefore(card, firstTechnicalKicker || null);\n        });\n      }\n\n      function moveCard(target, event) {\n        if (!dragged || dragged === target) return;\n        const rect = target.getBoundingClientRect();\n        const insertAfter = event.clientY > rect.top + rect.height / 2 || event.clientX > rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n        grid.insertBefore(dragged, insertAfter ? target.nextSibling : target);\n      }\n\n      applySavedLayout();\n\n      Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card[data-card]')).forEach(card => {\n        card.draggable = true;\n        card.title = 'Arrastra para mover esta tarjeta';\n        card.addEventListener('dragstart', event => {\n          dragged = card;\n          card.classList.add('dragging');\n          event.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = 'move';\n          event.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain', card.dataset.card);\n        });\n        card.addEventListener('dragend', () => {\n          card.classList.remove('dragging');\n          Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.drag-over')).forEach(el => el.classList.remove('drag-over'));\n          dragged = null;\n          saveLayout();\n        });\n        card.addEventListener('dragover', event => {\n          event.preventDefault();\n          if (dragged && dragged !== card) card.classList.add('drag-over');\n          moveCard(card, event);\n        });\n        card.addEventListener('dragleave', () => card.classList.remove('drag-over'));\n        card.addEventListener('drop', event => {\n          event.preventDefault();\n          card.classList.remove('drag-over');\n          moveCard(card, event);\n          saveLayout();\n        });\n      });\n\n      resetButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        localStorage.removeItem(DASHBOARD_LAYOUT_KEY);\n        location.reload();\n      });\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      initDraggableCards();\n      document.getElementById('bp-datetime').value = localDatetimeValue();\n      document.getElementById('bp-form').addEventListener('submit', event => {\n        event.preventDefault();\n        const reading = {\n          systolic: Number(document.getElementById('bp-sys').value),\n          diastolic: Number(document.getElementById('bp-dia').value),\n          pulse: document.getElementById('bp-pulse').value ? Number(document.getElementById('bp-pulse').value) : null,\n          recordedAt: new Date(document.getElementById('bp-datetime').value).toISOString(),\n          createdAt: new Date().toISOString()\n        };\n        const readings = loadBpReadings();\n        readings.push(reading);\n        saveBpReadings(readings);\n        event.target.reset();\n        document.getElementById('bp-datetime').value = localDatetimeValue();\n        renderBp();\n      });\n      document.getElementById('bp-export').addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(loadBpReadings(), null, 2)], { type: 'application/json' });\n        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n        const a = document.createElement('a');\n        a.href = url;\n        a.download = 'tension-arterial.json';\n        a.click();\n        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n      });\n      document.getElementById('bp-clear').addEventListener('click', () => {\n        if (confirm('¿Borrar todos los registros de tensión arterial guardados en este navegador?')) {\n          localStorage.removeItem(BP_STORAGE_KEY);\n          renderBp();\n        }\n      });\n      renderBp();\n    });\n\n[4 more lines in file. Use offset=580 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778484736991}}
