{"type":"message","id":"18eec746","parentId":"0ea82a15","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:36:52.354Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hecho, Albert.\n\nEn **Uso LLM / tokens** añadí:\n\n- **Tokens totales:** 22.8k\n- Entrada: 21k\n- Salida: 1.8k\n- Contexto: 11%\n\nLo dejé como **Total diario · snapshot manual**, porque de momento es el total estimado del día según el último snapshot, no contador automático perfecto en vivo.\n\nVerificado: dashboard carga OK y JS correcto.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0187123ef08191b3cc7ffd75dd9fdf\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":918,"output":99,"cacheRead":55296,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56313,"cost":{"input":0.00459,"output":0.00297,"cacheRead":0.027648,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.035208}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778485007704,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01870fee74819190b5fefeb38b036a"}}
