tools.alsoAllow: [\"browser\"]\n```\n\no equivalente en la configuración del agente principal/Telegram.\n\nCon eso yo podría:\n- abrir `http://127.0.0.1:8765/dashboard/`,\n- sacar captura,\n- inspeccionar visualmente,\n- ajustar CSS,\n- verificar si la gráfica se ve bien.\n\nRecomendación: no instales nada aún. Primero hay que **permitirme usar el tool `browser`** en esta sesión.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01897635308191a21b57a358a8c134\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":611,"output":579,"cacheRead":67584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68774,"cost":{"input":0.0030550000000000004,"output":0.01737,"cacheRead":0.033791999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.054216999999999994}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778485613296,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01896d76fc819182fc241f87a71206"}}
