{"type":"message","id":"c8de3571","parentId":"ac477902","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:57:25.060Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dWYd0bcrCqiRoPCnMvv30DZj|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018bdeb4e481918b85b6ebd0f9a672","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"set -e\n# Basic validation: no executable files inside the skill, frontmatter present, name matches folder\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('/openclaw/workspace/skills/security-first-action-review/SKILL.md')\ns=p.read_text()\nassert s.startswith('---\\n'), 'missing frontmatter'\nassert 'name: security-first-action-review' in s, 'wrong skill name'\nassert 'description:' in s, 'missing description'\nassert '# Security First Action Review' in s, 'missing title'\nprint('skill file validation ok')\nPY\nfind /openclaw/workspace/skills/security-first-action-review -type f -perm /111 -print -quit | grep -q . && { echo 'unexpected executable file'; exit 1; } || echo 'no executable files ok'\n# List resulting skill file\nls -l /openclaw/workspace/skills/security-first-action-review/SKILL.md\nprintf '%s\\n' '- Se creó la skill local `/skills/security-first-action-review/SKILL.md` tras confirmación explícita de Albert. La skill implementa revisión previa de acciones sensibles, REDFLAGS, anti prompt-injection, confirmación explícita YELLOW/ORANGE, bloqueo RED y formato obligatorio de salida. Validación básica OK; no contiene scripts ejecutables.' >> /openclaw/workspace/memory/2026/05/11.md","workdir":"/openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":2034,"output":341,"cacheRead":82432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84807,"cost":{"input":0.01017,"output":0.01023,"cacheRead":0.041215999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.061616}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778486236027,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018bdc2db48191ab603da5c9ef60e6"}}
