{"type":"message","id":"0d9d48db","parentId":"0b6a50d6","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:57:30.472Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hecho, Albert ✅\n\nCreé la skill aquí:\n\n`/openclaw/workspace/skills/security-first-action-review/SKILL.md`\n\nValidado:\n- Tiene frontmatter correcto.\n- Nombre en formato OpenClaw: `security-first-action-review`.\n- No contiene scripts ejecutables.\n- Incluye REDFLAGS, anti prompt-injection, confirmación YELLOW/ORANGE y bloqueo RED.\n- Incluye el formato obligatorio de respuesta.\n\nNota: para que OpenClaw la cargue como skill disponible, normalmente hará falta **nueva sesión** o reinicio del gateway.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018be7f7f88191b3d99256ac9b652b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":899,"output":123,"cacheRead":83968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84990,"cost":{"input":0.004495000000000001,"output":0.00369,"cacheRead":0.041984,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.050169000000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778486245112,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018be5821c8191821a6111b34a575b"}}
