{"type":"message","id":"c6da2d8a","parentId":"c6af0f5c","timestamp":"2026-05-11T08:02:36.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering gateway status**\n\nI think I should check the exec openclaw status to see if the gateway is okay. If it’s GREEN, I might not even need to confirm anything further. It seems like a straightforward situation, but I should probably add a brief note about it just to make sure everything’s clear. I want to be thorough, you know? It always helps to communicate the status clearly!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a018d1418788191b4d8130fdc7198c9\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAY0cQBWGWW51Mt4CGrkKihfxpKRuMX8gFhxOSVJsRc_ITo2k0-o_f7LB5Shg4oR1w7-CJxr0W2WSg9OHWbt2Q9MBUwFqYrkw6gcWPnul_wYRPl1cFw21WsQAZVMvCjBqQBceFq6C-IObj2zvSS1spH0rp7RrPBaKqgTnxM_EQR9_KN03yKifCtcQb1p3WbMbZ6adcwNrJZ7j38xTye_OL9T7jLXcrHEVtEH1nDaoxNwLzuyERZFQvqQeehjCDQmiGHAVWJnw0fG0YOcgXg29zUrVpXmb4kNhCE9MPiMIhvXDoxYe2B6BNdWzgp7KPfkQofcSwUOOFvywPus17_smaGs-wKl7mm_q0frSetDT_9KTFLTUO1p7vvJ_M_TNiu8_eXwUFwgWDkC81oib0aossc8EKUr67HNVCn0JuPY8ZjI75PY84hS68LkAw8Iwbm3Sd4timZMWt4lVzFObBu-mEDelAorrMhCXIQIVtnmgQKFuqwY4rG43Ed8jKBAvYE5gOj7UNb8qPEU4_riYDEIkhSyhkbTGNxMPI9mjj-P6P59_wJBBrIbnRKeLi033jif202vjVVPmUQak-DRUIYS1Y2TO33VhjoOUEaiQqpFkHElqGSal3m486Ar0BOxgxMzYuiA1TasaToIKTmb5LmiBWoeVjLX3PuLAJn-cI2pSpCcznoWB1McLZyxwB3mEJLgJV4OLpcEosE4bLBNGAFr-4vKqeIjRgaDM1X2UPRfEcS421AMHp2oCSt4QX0Qqo5DnmzYOAkYQTHUSFHUK0D3SHuHV8dBBCbsjIj_Uz9mFqEZu7jXVIjLGFVLuOMbTDR5xmQNf9TcaTZ4De6JCF4rEOoDW7Rg9uOSw-MbTpKJDTIPp3rSRQlTy22TG2-vuHABsoZWJX_Z8Myetd-SeKC0HGJ_2L3aagz3M1NRCHpXqFmJunoFDy9p2RByz2QbxNvTEHLo_Y2DCSl-l-tl6X7jIEqYueKrJbq6mMphlco5kpsgUfiaMO7SLSN_K9oyzKUTNYzL5TIfG2Hk-QN97ag31y2vEKlu0BE216iF9Kb8tLCg0vuHly4wPvMYO9p7Lt4Hn3wr_Ds2Oqi4-IsSXBWz1Pe1Kmx6s6Vz9AUi9DBGmB9-Teq7dCSdKuO-A02hUBk1H-yf313VJeTVEfPsDFPqMJDcspejrpqZrm7VdsJxSsUVCZcnEyvbUCcaZF2bUGI5bWTkC8Z9lmWSFxDfeFyyMaTwqoYlUsVLcls90GaH2BpW9g9GVLx_0Bd1cuBq1gv1q8BLoqcuhtKS5iotyFn