 the left. This could reduce the empty center as well. I'm thinking of setting the BP to span four columns and two rows, with the system in row one and the cards in rows two to four. I also need to manage heights across the rows effectively.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"La última captura muestra el motivo: mi `grid-row: span 5` estaba reservando demasiado espacio invisible debajo de tensión arterial. No se solapan tarjetas, pero sí queda un “bloque fantasma” central. Lo reduzco ahora.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a019215293c8191b08b157147d029d9\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_shs6LaMLhmYYBNvAd25q6dCI|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01921607048191a82550c450587d6c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html')\ns=p.read_text()\ns=s.replace('''      #blood-pressure-section {\n        grid-column: 1 / span 4;\n        grid-row: 1 / span 5;\n      }''','''      #blood-pressure-section {\n        grid-column: 1 / span 4;\n        grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n      }''')\ns=s.replace('''      .section-kicker { grid-row: 6; }''','''      .section-kicker { grid-row: auto; }''')\ns=s.replace('''      [data-card=\"token-efficiency\"] { grid-column: 1 / span 3; }\n      [data-card=\"tools-plugins\"] { grid-column: 4 / span 3; }''','''      [data-card=\"token-efficiency\"] { grid-column: 1 / span 3; grid-row: auto; }\n      [data-card=\"tools-plugins\"] { grid-column: 4 / span 3; grid-row: auto; }''')\ns=s.replace('''      height: clamp(260px, 30vh, 340px);''','''      height: clamp(240px, 28vh, 320px);''')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\nfrom pathlib import Path\nHTMLParser().feed(Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text())\nprint('html parse ok')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY' >/tmp/dashboard-bp.js\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\ns=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text()\nprint(re.findall(r'<script>(.*?)</script>', s, re.S)[0])\nPY\nnode --check /tmp/dashboard-bp.js\npython3 -m http.server 8766 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory /openclaw/workspace >/tmp/dashboard-test.log 2>&1 & pid=$!; sleep 1\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8766/dashboard/ | grep -q 'grid-row: 1 / span 2'\nkill $pid; wait $pid 2>/dev/null || true\nprintf '%s\\n' '- Tras captura donde quedaba hueco central, se redujo la reserva vertical de tensión arterial de `grid-row: span 5` a `span 2`, se liberó el separador técnico para flujo automático y se bajó ligeramente la altura de la gráfica.' >> /openclaw/workspace/memory/2026/05/11.md\necho 'dashboard ghost-space reduction check ok'","workdir":"/openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":1129,"output":1218,"cacheRead":109568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111915,"cost":{"input":0.005645000000000001,"output":0.03654,"cacheRead":0.054784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.096969}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778487807486,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a019200e2d081918dfdf0b9685bc2ca"}}
