ype":"text","text":"La captura me da una pista importante: seguramente el navegador útil no llega al breakpoint de 1850px, así que no se está aplicando el layout “de escritorio” que preparé. Bajo ese breakpoint a 1400px y lo hago con 12 columnas para controlar mucho mejor el reparto.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0192c7ba0c81918b911807edea4b94\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_uC5RLG3iXPON04vDLUYCFa2T|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0192c800148191a4c83d90b7b4d946","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html')\ns=p.read_text()\nstart=s.index('    @media (min-width: 1200px) {')\nend=s.index('    section {', start)\nnew='''    @media (min-width: 1200px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n    }\n    @media (min-width: 1400px) {\n      .grid {\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));\n        gap: 12px;\n      }\n      #blood-pressure-section {\n        grid-column: 1 / span 8;\n        grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n      }\n      [data-card=\"system-health\"] { grid-column: 9 / span 4; grid-row: 1; }\n      [data-card=\"today\"] { grid-column: 9 / span 2; grid-row: 2; }\n      [data-card=\"health-mobility\"] { grid-column: 11 / span 2; grid-row: 2; }\n      [data-card=\"habits\"] { grid-column: 9 / span 2; grid-row: 3; }\n      [data-card=\"chaos\"] { grid-column: 11 / span 2; grid-row: 3; }\n      [data-card=\"security\"] { grid-column: 9 / span 2; grid-row: 4; }\n      [data-card=\"llm-tokens\"] { grid-column: 11 / span 2; grid-row: 4; }\n      .section-kicker { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: auto; }\n      [data-card=\"token-efficiency\"] { grid-column: 1 / span 6; grid-row: auto; }\n      [data-card=\"tools-plugins\"] { grid-column: 7 / span 6; grid-row: auto; }\n    }\n'''\ns=s[:start]+new+s[end:]\n# Improve density slightly\ns=s.replace('''    .compact { min-height: 94px; }''','''    .compact { min-height: 88px; }''')\ns=s.replace('''      height: clamp(240px, 28vh, 320px);''','''      height: clamp(235px, 27vh, 310px);''')\n# prevent old spans from causing min-width issues\nif '    .card { min-width: 0; width: 100%; }' not in s:\n    s=s.replace('''    .drag-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 6px; }''','''    .drag-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 6px; }\n    .card { min-width: 0; width: 100%; }''')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\nfrom pathlib import Path\nHTMLParser().feed(Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text())\nprint('html parse ok')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY' >/tmp/dashboard-bp.js\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\ns=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text()\nprint(re.findall(r'<script>(.*?)</script>', s, re.S)[0])\nPY\nnode --check /tmp/dashboard-bp.js\npython3 -m http.server 8766 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory /openclaw/workspace >/tmp/dashboard-test.log 2>&1 & pid=$!; sleep 1\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8766/dashboard/ | grep -q 'repeat(12'\nkill $pid; wait $pid 2>/dev/null || true\nprintf '%s\\n' '- Tras captura donde el layout de escritorio no parecía aplicarse, se bajó el breakpoint principal a 1400px y se cambió a grid explícito de 12 columnas: tensión arterial 8/12, columna derecha 4/12 con tarjetas en pares, observabilidad 6/12 + 6/12. Se compactaron ligeramente tarjetas y gráfica.' >> /openclaw/workspace/memory/2026/05/11.md\necho 'dashboard 12-column breakpoint check ok'","workdir":"/openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":4586,"output":1412,"cacheRead":112128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118126,"cost":{"input":0.022930000000000002,"output":0.04236,"cacheRead":0.056063999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.12135399999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778487992444,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a0192b8ab7081919467d27aec0fa976"}}
