eeds to be addressed.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Updating layout with Python**\\n\\nI'm thinking of using Python to replace the content from `<div class=\\\"grid\\\">` to the footer. I need to make sure to replace only the relevant CSS sections while preserving existing IDs. It looks like using cards as divs with specific classes could work well for this. My goal is to create four equal panels, which will make the layout clean and organized. I’ll have to ensure everything aligns properly once I make these changes.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Confirmación recibida. Paso a un diseño más ordenado: 4 bloques principales iguales, en 2×2, con el contenido agrupado dentro.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a019432a5dc81919405feb81daaddb5\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PCrzO3CXTcdLll2riVLm0amV|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a019432c3b48191a10af4d0c458222f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html')\ns=p.read_text()\n# Replace CSS from .grid to before footer-ish section styles by targeted surgery\nstart=s.index('    .grid {')\nend=s.index('    footer {', start)\nnew_css='''    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      width: min(1720px, 100%);\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .dashboard-block {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      min-height: 410px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .block-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.08rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n    }\n    .block-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n    .block-grid.single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .block-grid.fill { flex: 1; }\n    .mini-card {\n      background: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 12px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n    .mini-card.primary {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n    .mini-card.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n    .mini-card.compact { min-height: 92px; }\n    .mini-card h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .technical h3 { color: var(--muted); }\n    @media (max-width: 1100px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .dashboard-block { min-height: auto; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 720px) {\n      .block-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .mini-card.full { grid-column: auto; }\n    }\n    h2, h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }\n    li { margin: 4px 0; }\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .85rem;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .safe { color: var(--ok); }\n    .warn { color: var(--warn); }\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 5px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n    .bar {\n      height: 9px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      margin: 4px 0 8px;\n    }\n    .bar > span {\n      display: block;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: inherit;\n      background: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .bar .ok { background: var(--ok); }\n    .bar .warn-bg { background: var(--warn); }\n    .small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n    .form-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    label { color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; }\n    input, button {\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--text);\n      padding: 8px;\n      font: inherit;\n    }\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #07111f;\n      border: 0;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    button.secondary {\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    canvas {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: clamp(220px, 25vh, 300px);\n      display: block;\n      background: #0b1017;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      margin: 8px 0 10px;\n    }\n    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; max-height: 155px; }\n    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .92rem; }\n    th, td { padding: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; }\n    th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }\n    .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    .actions button { width: auto; min-width: 150px; }\n\n'''\ns=s[:start]+new_css+s[end:]\n# Replace grid HTML\nstart=s.index('    <div class=\"grid\">')\nend=s.index('    <footer>', start)\nnew_grid='''    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Salud</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid single fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\" id=\"blood-pressure-section\">\n            <h3>Tensión arterial</h3>\n            <p class=\"small\">Registro privado. Guarda sistólica, diastólica, pulso y fecha/hora.</p>\n            <form id=\"bp-form\">\n              <div class=\"form-row\">\n                <label>Sistólica\n                  <input id=\"bp-sys\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"60\" max=\"260\" placeholder=\"120\" required />\n                </label>\n                <label>Diastólica\n                  <input id=\"bp-dia\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"40\" max=\"160\" placeholder=\"80\" required />\n                </label>\n                <label>Pulso opcional\n                  <input id=\"bp-pulse\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"30\" max=\"220\" placeholder=\"70\" />\n                </label>\n                <label>Fecha y hora\n                  <input id=\"bp-datetime\" type=\"datetime-local\" required />\n                </label>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"actions\">\n                <button type=\"submit\">Añadir lectura</button>\n                <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"bp-export\" type=\"button\">Exportar JSON</button>\n                <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"bp-clear\" type=\"button\">Borrar registros</button>\n              </div>\n            </form>\n            <canvas id=\"bp-chart\" width=\"900\" height=\"260\" aria-label=\"Gráfica de tensión arterial\" role=\"img\"></canvas>\n            <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n              <table>\n                <thead>\n                  <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sistólica</th><th>Diastólica</th><th>Pulso</th></tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody id=\"bp-table-body\">\n                  <tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"small\">Todavía no hay lecturas.</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">MVP local · datos en localStorage + JSONL diario</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"block-grid\">\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Salud / movilidad</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Dolor 0-10: —</li>\n                <li>Rigidez: —</li>\n                <li>Estiramientos: —</li>\n              </ul>\n              <span class=\"pill\">MVP salud</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Hábitos</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Sueño: —</li>\n                <li>Alimentación: —</li>\n                <li>Deporte: —</li>\n              </ul>\n              <span class=\"pill\">Pilares diarios</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Día</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary compact\">\n            <h3>Hoy</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Prioridad: pendiente.</li>\n              <li>Top 3: log diario.</li>\n              <li>Resumen: 09:00.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill\">/daily/YYYY/MM/DD.md</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Pendientes / caos</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Capturar.</li>\n              <li>Priorizar.</li>\n              <li>Convertir en pasos.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill warn\">Anticaos</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Seguridad</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"safe\">Privado.</span></li>\n              <li>No expuesto a internet.</li>\n              <li>Sin credenciales.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Solo Albert + neodaemon</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Alertas</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Críticas: 0</li>\n              <li>Revisión tokens: activa.</li>\n              <li>Backups: ligero diario.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Bajo ruido</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block technical\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Sistema</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\">\n            <h3>Salud del sistema</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Estabilidad</span><strong class=\"safe\">100/100</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Gateway uptime</span><strong>13h 40m</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>RAM</span><strong>14% · 1689/11800 MB</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>CPU load</span><strong>0.07 · 0.04 · 0.00</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Loops detectados</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Observación MVP · sin reinicio automático</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Uso LLM / tokens</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens totales</span><strong>22.8k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Entrada</span><strong>21k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Salida</span><strong>1.8k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Contexto</span><strong>11%</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Total diario · snapshot manual</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Automatizaciones</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Cron activos</span><strong>3</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Heartbeat</span><strong>30m</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Modo bajo ruido</span><strong>22-08</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Controlado</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block technical\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Observabilidad</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card\">\n            <h3>Eficiencia · tokens por tarea útil</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tareas útiles hoy</span><strong>1</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens / tarea útil</span><strong>~16.5k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Picos anómalos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Bajo valor / repetitivas</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <p class=\"small\">Canales hoy</p>\n            <div class=\"small\">Telegram · ~16.5k</div>\n            <div class=\"bar\"><span class=\"warn-bg\" style=\"width: 72%\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"small\">TUI · 0</div>\n            <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width: 0%\"></span></div>\n            <span class=\"pill warn\">MVP local · estimado</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card\">\n            <h3>Tools / plugins</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins descubiertos</span><strong>92</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins activos</span><strong>67</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins deshabilitados</span><strong>25</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugin doctor</span><strong class=\"safe\">limpio</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Skills elegibles</span><strong>7</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Advertencias</span><strong class=\"warn\">3 prudentes</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill warn\">Auditoría solo lectura</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n'''\ns=s[:start]+new_grid+s[end:]\n# Make drag init safe no-op when no data-card cards\ns=s.replace('''      const cards = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card[data-card]'));\n      const resetButton = document.getElementById('reset-layout');''','''      const cards = Array.from(grid.querySelectorAll('.card[data-card]'));\n      const resetButton = document.getElementById('reset-layout');\n      if (!cards.length) {\n        resetButton?.addEventListener('click', () => location.reload());\n        return;\n      }''')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\nfrom pathlib import Path\nHTMLParser().feed(Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text())\nprint('html parse ok')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY' >/tmp/dashboard-bp.js\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\ns=Path('/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/index.html').read_text()\nprint(re.findall(r'<script>(.*?)</script>', s, re.S)[0])\nPY\nnode --check /tmp/dashboard-bp.js\npython3 -m http.server 8766 --bind 127.0.0.1 --directory /openclaw/workspace >/tmp/dashboard-test.log 2>&1 & pid=$!; sleep 1\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8766/dashboard/ | grep -q 'dashboard-block'\nkill $pid; wait $pid 2>/dev/null || true\nprintf '%s\\n' '- Albert propuso concentrar el dashboard en 4 bloques iguales centrados 2x2. Se reestructuró el HTML/CSS en cuatro bloques principales: Salud, Día, Sistema y Observabilidad, con mini-cards internas. Se dejó el JS de drag como no-op seguro si no hay tarjetas `data-card`.' >> /openclaw/workspace/memory/2026/05/11.md\necho 'four block dashboard check ok'","workdir":"/openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":10021,"output":4777,"cacheRead":109056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":123854,"cost":{"input":0.050105000000000004,"output":0.14331,"cacheRead":0.054528,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.247943}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778488350837,"responseId":"resp_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a01941f9d848191a924e5f02c6a6ee8"}}
