{"type":"message","id":"0131519e","parentId":"94d61e29","timestamp":"2026-05-11T09:17:36.706Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8RH5AwcIsixkjxOyeLBvRQoL|fc_08a4b4c6f9f74abf016a019eabc75081919d4e56c8d8775340","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"--- agents ---\nAgents:\n- main (default)\n  Workspace: /openclaw/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent\n  Model: openai-codex/gpt-5.5\n  Routing rules: 0\n  Routing: default (no explicit rules)\nRouting rules map channel/account/peer to an agent. Use --bindings for full rules.\nChannel status reflects local config/creds. For live health: openclaw channels status --probe.\n--- config agents ---\n{\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"model\": {\n      \"primary\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.5\"\n    },\n    \"models\": {\n      \"openai/gemini-flash\": {\n        \"alias\": \"gemini-flash\"\n      },\n      \"openai-codex/gpt-5.5\": {}\n    },\n    \"workspace\": \"/openclaw/workspace\",\n    \"maxConcurrent\": 4,\n    \"subagents\": {\n      \"maxConcurrent\": 8\n    }\n  }\n}\n--- workspace task validator search ---"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3187,"aggregated":"--- agents ---\nAgents:\n- main (default)\n  Workspace: /openclaw/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent\n  Model: openai-codex/gpt-5.5\n  Routing rules: 0\n  Routing: default (no explicit rules)\nRouting rules map channel/account/peer to an agent. Use --bindings for full rules.\nChannel status reflects local config/creds. For live health: openclaw channels status --probe.\n--- config agents ---\n{\n  \"defaults\": {\n    \"model\": {\n      \"primary\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.5\"\n    },\n    \"models\": {\n      \"openai/gemini-flash\": {\n        \"alias\": \"gemini-flash\"\n      },\n      \"openai-codex/gpt-5.5\": {}\n    },\n    \"workspace\": \"/openclaw/workspace\",\n    \"maxConcurrent\": 4,\n    \"subagents\": {\n      \"maxConcurrent\": 8\n    }\n  }\n}\n--- workspace task valida